{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06083","headline":"青龙寺昙璧上人兄院集 · 王维","name":"青龙寺昙璧上人兄院集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高处敞招提，虚空讵有倪。\n坐看南陌骑，下听秦城鸡。\n眇眇孤烟起，芊芊远树齐。\n青山万井外，落日五陵西。\n眼界今无染，心空安可迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}